codex
The capture path has a concrete ordering hazard: it takes a screenshot with Playwright’s temporary `animations: "disabled"` behavior, then immediately measures hard gates after Playwright restores animations. That means the screenshot and gate snapshot can observe different layout phases; font/layout readiness is only awaited for specs with pixel baselines. I’m reproducing with retained artifacts now and separately tracing the sidebar’s startup state.
