The implementation now covers all three harness mechanisms: a capture-scoped motion freeze plus font/two-frame settle, explicit compact-vs-coarse pointer modeling for command-palette/Bombadil, and a single reload for terminal one-shot sidebar hydration. The harness suite is green at 94/94 (six new tests); I’m moving into repeated end-to-end proof.
